[en.FOCUS_C12_HIRE_DIAMOND_DOGS]
Hire Diamond Dogs

[en.FOCUS_C12_HIRE_DIAMOND_DOGS_desc]
Many Diamond Dogs from the Western Kingdom have come to the farm in search of opportunities to get rich. This race possesses an innate obsession with diamonds and a natural talent for mining. We can recruit the willing among them into our auxiliary forces, enabling our troops to quickly excavate trenches and defensive lines on the battlefield.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_HIRE_DIAMOND_DOGS]
雇佣钻石狗

[zh.FOCUS_C12_HIRE_DIAMOND_DOGS_desc]
许多来自西方王国的钻石狗来到农场寻找发财的机会，这个种族拥有与生俱来的对钻石的痴迷和对挖矿的天赋，我们可以聘请它们当中的有意向者进入辅助部队，方便我们的部队在战场上快速挖掘出战壕和防线。

